	•	Study Design: Retrospective Cohort
	•	AI Model Architecture: CNN
	•	Algorithm Name: 3D ResNet (SE ResNet50 3D) with multimodal fusion; EfficientNetB7 and ResNet50 comparator imaging pipelines
