	•	Hyperparameter Tuning Reported: Yes
	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The study tested four computer-vision architectures, including ResNet50 montage approaches, EfficientNetB7 slice-based extraction, and a pretrained “3D ResNet model (SE ResNet50 3D).” Clinical and imaging data were then fused by early, joint, and late fusion. Feature reduction used repeated LASSO with selection frequency thresholding. Model training used stratified 7-fold cross-validation plus held-out validation/test sets. Hyperparameters included focal-loss gamma testing and were selected during cross-validation.  ￼

Section 4: AI Quality & Reproducibility (CONVINCE Standards)
	•	Missing Data Handling: Simple Imputation
	•	Class Imbalance Addressed: Yes
